{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to flag a critical safety requirement before we proceed. My floor-load review found that Bay 7 may be used only with two 1.2-meter steel anchor plates under the palletizer feet and a 3-meter marked exclusion zone. I completed this review from the latest structural drawing, but the installation packet still shows the old unanchored layout. This needs to be corrected before deployment can be approved."}
```

